OL,3,GNEWSAMarket traders' fees set to soar
OL,4,Aunder proposals
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarket traders in parts of central
OL,7,FLondon could see their weekend pitch
OL,8,Ffees rise by 90%, under new proposals
OL,9,Fbrought by Westminster City Council.
OL,11,FVendors serving hot food in Soho,
OL,12,FWestminster, Marylebone and Maida Vale
OL,13,Fon Saturdays are likely to be the worst
OL,14,Fhit, while the cost of a permanent
OL,15,Ftrading licence could jump to #964 in
OL,16,Fthe borough.
OL,18,FThe council, which is facing a massive
OL,19,Fbudget shortfall, told a licensing
OL,20,Fcommittee it was currently running a
OL,21,Fdeficit of around #2.4m across its
OL,22,Fstreet trading budget.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
