OL,3,GNEWSAMarket traders' fees set to soar
OL,4,Aunder proposals
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the local authority
OL,7,Fsaid the measures would ensure a
OL,8,F"fairer, more sustainable system". If
OL,9,Fapproved they will come into effect in
OL,10,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
